{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/7fb99a81777f3671c1d2e69d29fe9b35.poster.avif?t=1763738049\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/7fb99a81777f3671c1d2e69d29fe9b35.webm?t=1763738049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KORRIDOR</strong> is a medieval shoot-them-up in which you slay hordes of demons with a massive Gatling gun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a mix between mobile gate runners and survivor-likes, featuring retro 3D graphics and a heavy metal soundtrack.\u00a0<br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the catacombs and explore <strong>4 unique levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down hundreds of demons with your machine gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with 30 items and experiment with <strong>dozens of playstyles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in many <strong>leaderboard</strong> categories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy bosses and loot powerful artifacts!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obtain 66 achievements</strong>\u00a0that will put your game knowledge to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a<strong> heavy metal soundtrack</strong> and<strong> intense action scenes</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/581a49181ee311a30f4a79f3efc05f45.poster.avif?t=1763738049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/581a49181ee311a30f4a79f3efc05f45.webm?t=1763738049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also unlock many items of <strong>historical trivia\u00a0</strong>about the central middle ages (years 1000 - 1300), on topics like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The role of the church, Papacy, and monk orders in medieval society</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relationship between Kings and Popes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusades and heresies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Philosophy</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739580?t=1763738049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/409c8e5477d73423e3cf6a641bbb319bc804a277/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763738049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/282a472fddb8bff59d495bd579ea50a1e178b909/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763738049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/282a472fddb8bff59d495bd579ea50a1e178b909/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763738049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3849780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/7fb99a81777f3671c1d2e69d29fe9b35.poster.avif?t=1763738049\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/7fb99a81777f3671c1d2e69d29fe9b35.webm?t=1763738049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KORRIDOR</strong> is a medieval shoot-them-up in which you slay hordes of demons with a massive Gatling gun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a mix between mobile gate runners and survivor-likes, featuring retro 3D graphics and a heavy metal soundtrack.\u00a0<br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the catacombs and explore <strong>4 unique levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down hundreds of demons with your machine gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with 30 items and experiment with <strong>dozens of playstyles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in many <strong>leaderboard</strong> categories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy bosses and loot powerful artifacts!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obtain 66 achievements</strong>\u00a0that will put your game knowledge to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a<strong> heavy metal soundtrack</strong> and<strong> intense action scenes</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/extras/581